      "controles": {
        "web": "He said to his mother, “The eleven hundred pieces of silver that were taken from you, about which you uttered a curse, and also spoke it in my ears, behold, the silver is with me; I took it.”   His mother said, “Blessed be my son of Yahweh.”",
        "kjv": "And he said unto his mother, The eleven hundred shekels of silver that were taken from thee, about which thou cursedst, and spakest of also in mine ears, behold, the silver is with me; I took it. And his mother said, Blessed be thou of the Lord, my son.",
        "livre": "O qual disse à sua mãe: Os mil e cem siclos de prata que te foram furtados, pelo que tu amaldiçoavas ouvindo-o eu, eis que eu tenho este dinheiro: eu o havia tomado. Então a mãe disse: Bendito sejas do SENHOR, filho meu."
      }
    },
